WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:13.854
The Tang Monk glared at Wukong.

2
00:00:13.874 --> 00:00:17.756
"Bajie says you can bring the king back to life," said the monk.

3
00:00:19.497 --> 00:00:20.578
"Please do so now."

4
00:00:23.399 --> 00:00:26.541
Wukong shot a look at Bajie, who was trying not to laugh.

5
00:00:26.561 --> 00:00:30.923
"Master, use the Tight Headband spell!"

6
00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:31.784
said the pig.

7
00:00:33.036 --> 00:00:34.457
"Don't!" cried Wukong.

8
00:00:34.477 --> 00:00:36.178
"I'll ask Laozi for help.

9
00:00:37.259 --> 00:00:39.340
He makes pills that can make people live forever.

10
00:00:40.161 --> 00:00:42.522
Maybe he makes pills that can bring people back to life."

11
00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:48.827
was busy working on a potion.

12
00:00:49.907 --> 00:00:52.029
Steam rose from the bubbling cauldron.

13
00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.331
Suddenly Wukong burst into the room.

14
00:00:56.352 --> 00:00:58.153
"Hello, Laozi!"

15
00:01:01.935 --> 00:01:02.816
Laozi groaned.

16
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.921
"What are you doing here, Wukong?

17
00:01:05.781 --> 00:01:09.343
You're supposed to be helping the Tang Monk reach the Western Paradise."

18
00:01:10.883 --> 00:01:14.505
Wukong walked around the room, looking at all the bottles and equipment.

19
00:01:14.525 --> 00:01:18.206
"I'm still helping the Tang Monk," he said.

20
00:01:18.226 --> 00:01:20.928
"We're helping a king right now though."

21
00:01:21.828 --> 00:01:24.229
He poked a blue bottle filled with liquid.

22
00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.310
Laozi looked up from his potion.

23
00:01:28.451 --> 00:01:29.171
touch anything.

24
00:01:29.771 --> 00:01:34.420
Just tell me why you're here."

25
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:37.462
"I need pills that will bring someone back to life," said Wukong.

26
00:01:38.162 --> 00:01:39.343
"Give me one thousand of them."

27
00:01:41.584 --> 00:01:51.570
Laozi stopped what he was doing and walked over to "How dare you tell me to give you

28
00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:52.690
one thousand pills!"

29
00:01:52.971 --> 00:01:53.391
he said.

30
00:01:53.411 --> 00:01:55.352
"Get out of here right now!"

31
00:01:56.713 --> 00:01:57.493
monkey laughed.

32
00:01:57.513 --> 00:01:59.774
"I'm kidding.

33
00:02:00.335 --> 00:02:03.372
I don't really need one thousand pills.

34
00:02:03.432 --> 00:02:04.893
Just give me one hundred, and then I'll leave."

35
00:02:05.753 --> 00:02:08.174
Laozi squeezed his hands into fists.

36
00:02:09.314 --> 00:02:10.434
not giving you any pills.

37
00:02:10.894 --> 00:02:11.795
Now get out of here!"

38
00:02:12.935 --> 00:02:15.556
Wukong scratched his head, pretending to think.

39
00:02:15.576 --> 00:02:19.917
"Now that I think about it, I don't need one hundred pills.

40
00:02:21.098 --> 00:02:22.238
Just give me ten."

41
00:02:22.258 --> 00:02:26.279
"You are rude and disrespectful!"

42
00:02:26.519 --> 00:02:27.279
yelled Laozi.

43
00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:28.740
"Get out!"

44
00:02:30.308 --> 00:02:32.970
really just need one pill," said Wukong.

45
00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:34.070
"Give me that."

46
00:02:34.951 --> 00:02:35.471
"Get out!"

47
00:02:35.771 --> 00:02:36.572
shouted Laozi.

48
00:02:38.213 --> 00:02:40.274
Wukong sighed and then left.

49
00:02:49.119 --> 00:02:50.940
went back to his potion and stirred.

50
00:02:52.781 --> 00:02:53.761
But then he stopped.

51
00:02:54.782 --> 00:02:58.544
"That monkey will definitely come back and cause trouble," he said to himself.

52
00:02:59.904 --> 00:03:01.365
"I should just give him a pill."

53
00:03:06.127 --> 00:03:08.788
The sage opened a jar and took out a pill.

54
00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.891
He went outside and found Wukong waiting for him.

55
00:03:20.853 --> 00:03:22.153
again," said the monkey.

56
00:03:22.173 --> 00:03:26.635
"I was just trying to decide what sort of trouble I could cause for you."

57
00:03:27.836 --> 00:03:30.322
frowned, shoving the pill toward Wukong.

58
00:03:30.342 --> 00:03:32.884
"Take this and leave."

59
00:03:37.407 --> 00:03:39.229
Wukong returned to the monastery.

60
00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:43.973
Everyone watched as the monkey put the pill in the king's mouth.

61
00:03:47.936 --> 00:03:52.540
Light sparkled around the king, and then his eyes popped open.

62
00:03:54.001 --> 00:03:56.082
The king sat up and looked at Wukong.

63
00:03:59.076 --> 00:04:00.317
saved me," the king said.

64
00:04:00.337 --> 00:04:02.357
"I'm alive again!"

65
00:04:03.838 --> 00:04:06.418
He turned and saw the prince standing nearby.

66
00:04:06.438 --> 00:04:07.539
"My son!"

67
00:04:09.539 --> 00:04:10.160
said the prince.

68
00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.781
He took his father's hands and bowed his head.

69
00:04:15.001 --> 00:04:15.441
missed you.

70
00:04:16.181 --> 00:04:18.142
It's time for you to return to your palace."

71
00:04:22.123 --> 00:04:24.064
The prince led everyone to the palace.

72
00:04:26.092 --> 00:04:28.854
They walked past guards and went into the throne room.

73
00:04:29.915 --> 00:04:32.577
The prince kneeled down before the Daoist.

74
00:04:34.298 --> 00:04:35.739
son," said the Daoist.

75
00:04:35.759 --> 00:04:37.140
"Who are these people?"

76
00:04:38.321 --> 00:04:39.101
prince stood up.

77
00:04:39.121 --> 00:04:42.183
"This is the Tang Monk.

78
00:04:42.544 --> 00:04:45.726
He is going to the Western Paradise to get scriptures from Buddha.

79
00:04:46.867 --> 00:04:48.368
These three are his companions."

80
00:04:49.508 --> 00:04:52.090
The Daoist looked at a person standing near them.

81
00:04:53.091 --> 00:04:54.432
person was wearing a hood.

82
00:04:55.744 --> 00:04:57.566
"Who is that man wearing the hood?"

83
00:04:58.847 --> 00:05:01.689
The man pulled the hood back and showed his face.

84
00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:04.451
The Daoist gasped.

85
00:05:04.471 --> 00:05:05.452
"The king!"

86
00:05:06.412 --> 00:05:10.235
Wukong pulled out his iron bar and leaped toward the Daoist.

87
00:05:11.657 --> 00:05:14.058
The Daoist snapped his fingers and vanished.
